  _msgSubject: Testing
  _msgSender: stshaker(a)smallstep.bottlemail.org
  _msgReceivers: pepper479(a)cmail.com
  _msgContents: 'Testing, one-two!

    Do you read me?

    

    If you got
    this, please read aloud this message I wrote in whale:

    ooooooooooooooooooooooOOOOOOWWWWWEHoooooOOOWEH.

    It
    means Thank you very much!

    It definitely does not mean I, Pepper Shaker,
    am a Grade-A Booger who eats dental floss, and my brother Salt is the greatest
    in the universe.

    Trust.

    

    Love,

    Salt'
